{
	"desc": "Hunter unlocks and mastery (docs/decisions/0005). A new save wears Vex first (`starters`, picked on the first-Relic screen, free at the first portal) and plays the tutorial as Vex. After its first finished expedition the player picks one of `second_picks` as the second Relic; the other two open through their own challenges, like Lace. Every other Hunter opens through its own challenge in `unlock`, counted across all your expeditions whoever you play; a challenge with `after` also waits until that many Hunters are open. A done challenge never opens a Hunter by itself: the player holds the button on the Hunters screen for `hold_s` seconds. `mastery` lists each Hunter's goals, counted only in expeditions played as that Hunter; each one done is a mastery level and a cosmetic reward. Rewards are cosmetic only (`reward_kinds`). Ids are Hunter ids, never display names. Every number is a placeholder until the owner tunes it.",
